<title>ANGOLA: THREE DIE IN SPANISH TRAWLER FIRE OFF ANGOLA.</title>
<headline>THREE DIE IN SPANISH TRAWLER FIRE OFF ANGOLA.</headline>
<dateline>LUANDA 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three sailors died in a fire on a Spanish trawler anchored off the harbour of Angola's capital Luanda, the daily Jornal de Angola said on Friday.</p>
<p>Spain's ambassador told state radio the nationality and names of the three crew members remained unclear. Fiver other sailors on board survived.</p>
<p>The paper did not say when the fire engulfed the Tere Neli Huelva trawler.</p>
